Z||000006||fiero_nightmare||10-21-2001||11:04 PM||||thank you everyone. yes i have ran the engine since i topped it off and after 70 miles it still has the knock. but now i am VERY VERY happy. after being very upset for these last couple of days and constantly complaining my dad finally decided to let me get another engine. all of the engines i have to chose from have over 110,000 miles and slight lifter tap but it is better then a loud knock. as soon as i get the new engine installed i am going to put some motor up in it and not take it over 2000 rpm until i have over 1000 miles on it just to be safe.  it is amazing how fast someone can go from being depressed to kinda happy (the best i usually get  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ).<P>------------------<BR>my 85 GT pics <P>http://communities.msn.com/russcars/85fierogt.msnw||||reg||1
